--- 没有 initializer_list：两种括号等价 ---
Config(int, bool): retries=10, verbose=1
Config(int, bool): retries=10, verbose=1
Config(int, double): retries=10, ratio=2.5
Config(int, double): retries=10, ratio=2.5
--- 有 initializer_list：花括号优先选它 ---
Reading(int, bool): count=10, valid=1
Reading(initializer_list<long double>): 2 个值
--- 空花括号表示“没有实参” ---
Reading() 默认构造
Reading(initializer_list<long double>): 0 个值
--- vector 的两种含义 ---
sized: 4 个元素，sized[0]=9
listed: 2 个元素，listed[0]=4，listed[1]=9
--- C++20：聚合体也能用圆括号 ---
p = (1,2)，q = (3,4)
